From 65422b6858afc59a54dd93e648dd1fcd359ae68f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 04:42:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fonts: Khmer OS Siemreap everywhere, no bold, smaller text

- layout: load the Siemreap web font (stand-in when Khmer OS Siemreap
  is not installed) instead of Inter / Kantumruy Pro / Noto Sans Khmer
- globals.css: one font stack starting with 'Khmer OS Siemreap', forced
  on every element except KaTeX math; font-weight forced to 400 so
  nothing is bold (inline styles included); math keeps its own fonts
- html font-size 14px (was the 16px default): almost every size in the
  app is in rem, so text and spacing shrink together
- tests: scripts/test-fonts.mjs (npm run test:fonts)
